                <head>97. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On September 24 Secretary Herter and Under Secretary Dillon met with Foreign
                    Minister Fujiyama and Ambassador Asakai in Washington. Assistant Secretary of
                    Defense Irwin also participated in the meeting, at which there was general
                    discussion of the security treaty negotiations, the current international
                    situation, GARIOA, trade issues, and the Algerian situation. Text of the
                    memorandum of conversation by Richard L. Sneider, Officer in Charge of Japanese
                    Affairs, is in the Supplement.</p>
            </div>
